#, php-format
msgid "The customs document is too large. The limit is %s."
msgstr "Tollidokument on liiga suur. Lubatud suurus on kuni %s."

#. translators: %s: order currency code, e.g. "USD"
#: admin/class-woocommerce-shopup-venipak-shipping-admin-dispatch.php:365
#, php-format
msgid "Enter the shipment value in EUR: this order is in %s."
msgstr "Sisestage saadetise väärtus eurodes: selle tellimuse valuuta on %s."

#: admin/class-woocommerce-shopup-venipak-shipping-admin-dispatch.php:376
#: admin/class-woocommerce-shopup-venipak-shipping-admin.php:126
msgid "The shipment value must be a positive number."
msgstr "Saadetise väärtus peab olema positiivne arv."

#. translators: %s: order total with its currency, e.g. "120.00 USD"
#: admin/class-woocommerce-shopup-venipak-shipping-admin-order-edit.php:220
#, php-format
msgid "Order total: %s — enter the value in EUR."
msgstr "Tellimuse summa: %s — sisestage väärtus eurodes."

#: admin/class-woocommerce-shopup-venipak-shipping-admin.php:127
msgid "The dispatch may still be running. Reload the order before dispatching again."
msgstr "Saadetise registreerimine võib veel kesta. Enne uuesti saatmist laadige tellimus uuesti."

#: admin/class-woocommerce-shopup-venipak-shipping-admin-dispatch.php:642
msgid "Shipments to Poland and Finland cannot mix packages up to 30 kg with heavier ones. Dispatch the heavier packages separately."
msgstr "Poola ja Soome saadetistes ei saa koos saata kuni 30 kg ja raskemaid pakette. Saatke raskemad paketid eraldi."

#: admin/class-woocommerce-shopup-venipak-shipping-admin-dispatch.php:646
msgid "Packages over 30 kg to Poland or Finland need width, height and length."
msgstr "Üle 30 kg pakettidel Poola või Soome peavad olema märgitud laius, kõrgus ja pikkus."

#: admin/class-woocommerce-shopup-venipak-shipping-admin-dispatch.php:1011
msgid "Shipments to countries outside LT, LV, EE, PL and FI need each package's dimensions and description. Enter them in the packages table on the order page and dispatch from there."
msgstr "Saadetised riikidesse väljaspool LT, LV, EE, PL ja FI vajavad iga paketi mõõtmeid ja kirjeldust. Sisestage need tellimuse lehe pakettide tabelisse ja saatke sealt."

#: admin/class-woocommerce-shopup-venipak-shipping-admin-dispatch.php:621
msgid "Fill in width, height, length and description for every package going outside LT, LV, EE, PL and FI."
msgstr "Täitke laius, kõrgus, pikkus ja kirjeldus iga paketi kohta, mis saadetakse väljapoole LT, LV, EE, PL ja FI."

#. translators: 1: column name, e.g. "Width"; 2: the store's dimension unit, e.g. "cm"
#: admin/class-woocommerce-shopup-venipak-shipping-admin-order-edit.php:321
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s, %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s, %2$s"

#: admin/class-woocommerce-shopup-venipak-shipping-admin-order-edit.php:266
msgid "Courier orders are delivered to the address. To send this order to a pickup point, change its shipping method to Venipak pickup point."
msgstr "Kulleritellimused toimetatakse aadressile. Selle tellimuse saatmiseks kättesaamispunkti muutke selle tarneviisiks Venipak kättesaamispunkt."

#. translators: 1: the store's dimension unit, e.g. "cm"; 2: a 30 x 20 x 10 cm box in that unit, e.g. "30 × 20 × 10"
#: admin/class-woocommerce-shopup-venipak-shipping-admin-dispatch.php:660
#, php-format
msgid "Package sizes are entered in %1$s, but one package comes out under 1 cm on every side. Check the sizes: a box of 30 × 20 × 10 cm is entered as %2$s."
msgstr "Pakkide mõõdud sisestatakse ühikutes %1$s, kuid ühe paki kõik küljed tulevad lühemad kui 1 cm. Kontrollige mõõte: 30 × 20 × 10 cm kast sisestatakse kujul %2$s."

#: admin/class-woocommerce-shopup-venipak-shipping-admin.php:128
msgid "Request failed. Please try again."
msgstr "Päring ebaõnnestus. Palun proovige uuesti."

